WEBVTT

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:24.000
Daiba 1 to headquarters.
No confirmation on injured.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
"Metropolitan Police Department"

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.583
This is headquarters. Copy that.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:34.708
Reinforcements are on their way.
Will arrive shortly.

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.083
Daiba 6 to headquarters. Zero-eight-three-zero.

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:39.000
Large-scale emergency deployment requested.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.625
This is headquarters.
Copy that. Request acknowledged.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.958
Daiba 1 to headquarters.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:46.708
The hijacked bus has been
secured by several <i>butei </i>personnel.

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.417
All the hostages seem uninjured.

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:54.708
Two gunshot wounds to the head!
Consciousness level E3V4!

00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:59.833
She's exhibiting signs of disorientation
and loss of consciousness!

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:06.125
To think that Mamiya
has such a killing technique...

00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.708
I never thought of that possibility.

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:22.250
What on earth is her origin?

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.875
I have no clue.

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:31.125
What should I do now...?

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:32.167
Her heartbeat is irregular!

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:34.167
"Metropolitan Police Department"

00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:38.792
They said that a bus was hijacked.

00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:40.750
Looks like they haven't found the hijacker.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.750
Another gun battle in this area?

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.792
Hey, hey, seriously?

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:47.500
Can't be...!

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:54.083
I'm not perfect.

00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:56.250
There are many things I can't do.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.208
Aria is...

00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:03.333
...an impeccable...

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:04.792
...<i>butei</i>...!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.875
"Aria's weak! Aria's really weak!
I cleared the stage effortlessly."

00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:50.042
Akari... Mamiya...

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.375
Come with me.

00:04:36.292 --> 00:04:38.250
"Breaking News"

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:43.542
Where's Akari?!

00:04:43.542 --> 00:04:45.250
We can't find her.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.917
She isn't answering our calls, either.

00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:51.458
Hey, look!

00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:56.542
Did she follow Aria to the hospital?

00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:03.667
Are you the one who hurt Aria?

00:05:03.667 --> 00:05:06.292
It was my friend who did it.

00:05:08.208 --> 00:05:09.958
Why?!

00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:14.000
I-U has been after Aria for a while.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:18.042
My friend is only interested in her.

00:05:18.042 --> 00:05:21.375
I'm only interested in you.

00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:24.542
It's been a while.

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:31.667
The Mamiyas' oral tradition...
"Secret Poison Takamakuri"...

00:05:31.667 --> 00:05:33.125
You know about it, don't you?

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:38.500
That's right. I like that look in your eyes.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.000
I want a Mamiya child with those eyes.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.958
I do like you, you know.

00:05:48.375 --> 00:05:52.042
Let's see... I think I'll make you my pet.

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:10.708
Don't go behind my back and mess with her!

00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:12.083
Takachiho!

00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:14.625
She's my friend.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:22.750
At any rate, I sowed a seed two years ago.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:27.875
Right... It'll bloom as
early as today or tomorrow.

00:06:30.667 --> 00:06:37.667
But if you become mine completely,
no one will have to get hurt.

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:45.625
I'll be at this place.

00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:47.083
Hold it!

00:07:13.792 --> 00:07:14.750
Nonoka!

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.083
Sis!

00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:20.708
I'm sorry to make you
come over here all of a sudden.

00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:22.250
How's Aria?

00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:25.583
"Treatment in Progress"

00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:27.750
We don't know yet.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.667
I'm sure she'll be fine.

00:07:29.667 --> 00:07:32.750
I have to stay here today, so...

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:33.583
"Tokyo - Nagano"

00:07:34.292 --> 00:07:35.792
Hm?

00:07:35.792 --> 00:07:38.583
Go stay with our aunt in Nagano for a while.

00:07:38.583 --> 00:07:40.792
Wh-What's going on?

00:07:40.792 --> 00:07:42.625
I'll explain the reason later.

00:07:49.792 --> 00:07:51.083
Ah...

00:07:51.917 --> 00:07:53.292
Nono...

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.333
Nonoka...?

00:07:57.625 --> 00:07:59.167
Nonoka...!

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:00.458
Nonoka!

00:08:06.917 --> 00:08:14.208
Her doctor said she's in stable condition
but she may lose her eyesight.

00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:23.583
What... do I do?

00:08:25.042 --> 00:08:27.542
"Treatment in Progress"

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.083
It's... my fault.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.542
I...

00:08:48.542 --> 00:08:50.833
...will become Kyochikutou's.

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:52.125
That's the only choice I have.

00:08:52.125 --> 00:08:53.125
Akari?

00:08:53.125 --> 00:08:54.500
Kyochikutou?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.708
Is that the woman from earlier?

00:08:57.708 --> 00:08:59.250
"Become hers"?

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:05.500
This wouldn't have happened if
it weren't for the Mamiya techniques...

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.042
What are the "Mamiya techniques"?

00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:18.042
I don't have the right to be Aria's Amica.

00:09:18.042 --> 00:09:20.167
She was right.

00:09:21.458 --> 00:09:26.583
I'm sorry, everyone, for keeping
a secret from you all this time.

00:09:26.583 --> 00:09:31.250
I shouldn't have enrolled
in Butei High in the first place.

00:09:35.417 --> 00:09:40.125
The Mamiyas... used to be
Shogunate spies a long time ago.

00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:44.208
They were like present-day intelligence agents.

00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:46.417
But I was told that it was a dangerous job

00:09:46.417 --> 00:09:49.625
constantly engaged in life-or-death battles.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.417
The combat techniques fostered in those battles

00:10:10.417 --> 00:10:12.417
have been passed down to their descendants.

00:10:29.125 --> 00:10:30.458
"Mamiya" "Mamiya"

00:10:30.458 --> 00:10:32.542
Akari... Nonoka...

00:10:32.542 --> 00:10:34.333
Remember this, okay?

00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:37.708
The Mamiya techniques are
all secret killing techniques.

00:10:37.708 --> 00:10:40.458
We're no longer in the
Sengoku Period nor in the Edo Era,

00:10:40.458 --> 00:10:45.417
so we, parents, are just passing
them down to our children.

00:10:45.417 --> 00:10:49.500
But no one knows when wartime will come again.

00:10:53.667 --> 00:10:55.167
If that time comes...

00:10:55.167 --> 00:10:57.792
Yep, yep.

00:10:57.792 --> 00:11:00.625
...fight in order to protect people.

00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:01.750
Okay!

00:11:03.333 --> 00:11:04.583
Here, Akari!

00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:07.875
Oof!

00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:09.667
"Mamiya"

00:11:10.917 --> 00:11:12.917
"Heart"

00:11:13.333 --> 00:11:15.292
I got it! I got it!

00:11:15.292 --> 00:11:17.708
You were able to do Tobiugachi!

00:11:17.708 --> 00:11:21.167
Take better advantage of
your opponent's charging power.

00:11:21.167 --> 00:11:22.208
Okay!

00:11:27.667 --> 00:11:29.000
"Fire Hydrant"
"Beware of fires"

00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:34.583
I'll teach you how to compound only
by using colored sand and weeds for now,

00:11:34.583 --> 00:11:36.333
since using real poisons is dangerous.

00:11:36.333 --> 00:11:37.708
Okay!

00:11:40.458 --> 00:11:41.708
Ah-choo!

00:11:44.375 --> 00:11:45.792
Takamakuri...

00:11:45.792 --> 00:11:49.667
Your success rate isn't increasing
at all from one in three, huh?

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:52.708
You won't be able to use it
in real battles if that's the case.

00:11:52.708 --> 00:11:57.000
We teach it only to the oldest child,
so make sure you learn it.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.208
I'll work harder!

00:11:58.208 --> 00:12:00.292
Yep, do your best.

00:12:04.375 --> 00:12:06.792
But two years ago...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.167
You should've surrendered without fighting.

00:12:25.458 --> 00:12:26.583
Where's Mom?

00:12:26.583 --> 00:12:28.792
In case of emergency, we run away separately!

00:12:28.792 --> 00:12:30.542
That's how it was decided, remember?!

00:12:39.083 --> 00:12:40.833
Nonoka! Are you okay?!

00:12:46.333 --> 00:12:47.417
Sis...

00:12:47.417 --> 00:12:49.167
Run, Nonoka!

00:12:52.583 --> 00:12:54.583
The Mamiya clan...

00:12:56.917 --> 00:12:58.917
...has been at odds with I-U,

00:12:58.917 --> 00:13:02.083
obstinately keeping their techniques secret.

00:13:02.083 --> 00:13:04.917
That's why they're being taken away like this.

00:13:04.917 --> 00:13:07.708
But you're still hiding something, aren't you?

00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:11.167
It's unfortunate for the girl
I'm holding with my left hand...

00:13:11.167 --> 00:13:12.292
...but I'm poisoning her.

00:13:12.292 --> 00:13:13.625
Nonoka!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:17.792
My name is Kyochikutou.

00:13:17.792 --> 00:13:19.750
I'll come back to see you someday.

00:13:23.125 --> 00:13:27.958
After that, our clan scattered
and has been living in hiding.

00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:34.458
She's in quite a dangerous state...

00:13:37.542 --> 00:13:41.750
After losing her eyesight, she'll lose her
hearing, and then her sense of taste.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.458
After eight days or so,
her life will be lost, too.

00:13:48.333 --> 00:13:51.250
Nonoka's condition is caused by Fuchou Poison,

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:56.042
which takes away one's five senses
and life two years after being injected.

00:13:56.042 --> 00:13:58.500
This is Kyochikutou's MO.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.542
Oh, no...!

00:14:00.542 --> 00:14:03.000
Nonoka...

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.000
I apologize for my clan's mistake.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.167
Fuchou Poison was originally Fuma's technique.

00:14:09.167 --> 00:14:12.875
It was stolen by Kyochikutou several years ago.

00:14:12.875 --> 00:14:14.292
That woman...

00:14:14.292 --> 00:14:16.833
Can't that poison be neutralized?

00:14:16.833 --> 00:14:18.375
It can.

00:14:18.375 --> 00:14:21.333
But only the person who
produced the poison can do it.

00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:23.917
In other words, only Kyochikutou can do it.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.750
Akari...?

00:14:33.042 --> 00:14:35.167
I'm going to see Kyochikutou.

00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:36.250
Don't do it!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.292
Please wait!

00:14:37.292 --> 00:14:39.250
Don't follow me!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.958
Sacrificing myself will solve...

00:14:41.958 --> 00:14:43.292
...things.

00:14:43.292 --> 00:14:47.458
Self-sacrifice is
praiseworthy only in fairy tales.

00:14:51.708 --> 00:14:53.875
In reality, it's a way to evade problems.

00:14:55.708 --> 00:14:57.875
Aria!

00:14:57.875 --> 00:14:58.792
How're your injuries?

00:14:58.792 --> 00:15:01.750
Your situation is more important.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.875
I heard everything.
So I-U has been after you, too, huh?

00:15:06.875 --> 00:15:08.500
Aria...

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.458
I-U is my enemy, too.

00:15:11.458 --> 00:15:13.833
It's a long story.

00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:15.083
Akari...

00:15:15.083 --> 00:15:17.250
You've been hiding things about yourself

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:20.917
and suppressing your
real abilities all this time.

00:15:20.917 --> 00:15:24.208
That's why your <i>butei </i>rank stays low.

00:15:24.208 --> 00:15:25.583
Am I wrong?

00:15:27.708 --> 00:15:32.958
Had I known I-U was your enemy too,
we could've done things differently.

00:15:34.875 --> 00:15:38.833
The Mamiya techniques are
to be used for killing people.

00:15:38.833 --> 00:15:41.417
So I just couldn't bring myself to tell you...

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:46.917
It may be true that it's all
because of the Mamiya techniques.

00:15:46.917 --> 00:15:49.500
But what about your mother's wishes?

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.458
What about the principle
of fighting to protect people?

00:15:52.458 --> 00:15:55.917
I... want to follow that!

00:15:55.917 --> 00:15:58.875
That's why I enrolled in Butei High and...

00:15:58.875 --> 00:16:02.292
You've been trying to correct
the Mamiya techniques, huh?

00:16:02.292 --> 00:16:05.750
Because the <i>Butei </i>Law forbids killing.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:10.958
But... It's not so easy to get rid
of the habits ingrained in my body.

00:16:10.958 --> 00:16:14.542
Even so, arrest your enemy as a <i>butei</i>!

00:16:18.833 --> 00:16:22.125
I can't... do it.

00:16:22.125 --> 00:16:26.292
I thought I taught you not to say, "I can't"!

00:16:26.292 --> 00:16:30.292
Don't say "I can't" for the rest of your life.

00:16:30.292 --> 00:16:34.458
That's a bad phrase that
holds back your potential.

00:16:36.667 --> 00:16:42.625
I've lost most of the Mamiya techniques!

00:16:42.625 --> 00:16:47.833
I sealed off old things, but I haven't
been able to learn new things!

00:16:47.833 --> 00:16:52.000
I don't have anything right now!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:57.667
You're wrong, Akari. You're forgetting
something important that you have.

00:16:59.833 --> 00:17:01.917
What is that?

00:17:01.917 --> 00:17:03.792
If you turn around, you'll see it.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:14.167
That's right. You have something I don't have.

00:17:14.167 --> 00:17:15.375
Everyone...

00:17:21.292 --> 00:17:25.167
Year 1! Recite Butei Charter Article 1!

00:17:25.167 --> 00:17:28.625
Trust in your comrades and help them!

00:17:28.625 --> 00:17:29.875
Everyone...

00:17:32.708 --> 00:17:37.208
Akari... This is your first operation.

00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:42.000
Bring down your own enemy.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:46.375
I will repay my enemy for these injuries.

00:17:46.375 --> 00:17:48.417
Here's the operation code name.

00:17:53.125 --> 00:17:56.500
I got it from the initials
of our names, Aria and Akari.

00:17:57.833 --> 00:17:59.042
It's "AA."

00:18:06.875 --> 00:18:10.500
Everyone, you can hear me, can't you, right?

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.917
Don't get nervous. Calm down.

00:18:13.917 --> 00:18:16.625
What're you talking about
what I'm saying are you?

00:18:16.625 --> 00:18:18.417
I'm not nervous at all.

00:18:18.417 --> 00:18:24.417
You are. You're so nervous
that your speech is messed up.

00:18:24.417 --> 00:18:27.208
This is a perfect place
to position myself. I'm so good.

00:18:27.208 --> 00:18:29.917
She only did as instructed.

00:18:29.917 --> 00:18:31.792
But I find that confidence of hers...

00:18:33.375 --> 00:18:33.833
"Ya" "Yu"

00:18:33.833 --> 00:18:36.708
...so wonderful!

00:18:36.708 --> 00:18:39.083
Shut up! I can't focus!

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:42.875
Let's go!

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:44.042
Right!

00:18:50.125 --> 00:18:51.458
Ah...

00:19:50.667 --> 00:19:52.667
I came to talk.

00:19:58.542 --> 00:20:00.542
The deal is simple.

00:20:06.292 --> 00:20:11.375
Your sister is suffering from Fuchou Poison.
I'll give you the antidote.

00:20:11.375 --> 00:20:15.417
In return, I want Takamakuri,
the Mamiyas' secret poison,

00:20:15.417 --> 00:20:18.542
as well as yourself as an extra prize.

00:20:18.542 --> 00:20:20.875
Takamakuri isn't a poison!

00:20:20.875 --> 00:20:22.542
Don't play dumb.

00:20:28.542 --> 00:20:30.417
That's our book of secrets
that they stole from us!

00:20:30.417 --> 00:20:34.875
It said, "Slipping through a thousand arrows,
death is caused by one touch.

00:20:34.875 --> 00:20:38.917
Takamakuri is a technique that doesn't
leave any scratches on the body."

00:20:38.917 --> 00:20:41.542
Only poisons can do that.

00:20:41.542 --> 00:20:44.500
Arsenic is tasteless,
odorless, and water-soluble.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:49.750
If you have 1 kg of botulinus,
you can annihilate all of mankind.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:54.542
Oleander, also known as <i>kyochikutou</i>,
is an oral toxic that blooms in the field.

00:20:54.542 --> 00:21:00.417
I can't allow there to be poisons
unknown to me in this world.

00:21:00.417 --> 00:21:03.417
So give me Takamakuri.

00:21:03.417 --> 00:21:07.458
I want it... I really, really want it.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:12.500
I can't give it to someone like you!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:16.042
This hotel is already surrounded by my friends!

00:21:16.042 --> 00:21:18.458
Whoa, that's surprising.

00:21:18.458 --> 00:21:21.542
We've received training
in encirclement, you know!

00:21:21.542 --> 00:21:22.833
I didn't mean that.

00:21:22.833 --> 00:21:23.667
What?

00:21:23.667 --> 00:21:27.417
I'm surprised to see a tree frog
is standing against a poisonous snake.

00:21:29.208 --> 00:21:32.208
I'll give you one last chance.

00:21:32.208 --> 00:21:34.833
Come join I-U, Akari.

00:21:34.833 --> 00:21:37.000
You've been chosen.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:40.208
I'll take care of you and help you grow.

00:21:40.208 --> 00:21:42.417
You can become strong...

00:21:42.417 --> 00:21:45.708
Stronger than Aria Kanzaki.

00:21:45.708 --> 00:21:48.750
I'll never become... yours!

00:21:50.958 --> 00:21:52.458
It's started.

00:21:55.417 --> 00:21:57.083
Kyochikutou...!

00:22:00.125 --> 00:22:04.375
In the language of flowers,
oleander means "dangerous love."

00:22:07.708 --> 00:22:10.917
"Episode 10: First Mission"
Let's play.

00:23:41.458 --> 00:23:43.583
How do you want to die?

00:23:43.583 --> 00:23:45.083
I'll continue to pursue her.

00:23:45.083 --> 00:23:47.083
Then I'll just shoot them all down...!

00:23:47.083 --> 00:23:47.583
What?!

00:23:47.583 --> 00:23:48.250
Akari!

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:50.792
No! <i>Butei </i>cannot kill!

00:23:50.792 --> 00:23:52.917
Hurry up and show me Takamakuri.

00:23:52.917 --> 00:23:54.750
Kyochikutou...!

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.160
"Episode 11: Showdown"
